Z||000000||sluppy123||07-17-2001||06:38 PM||||these are some pics of the turbo I'm installing on my 87 GT. I had a N2O system installed but wanted the power all the time  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> It's a .63 a/r T-3 from a 86 T-bird, I plan to run around 7-8 psi of boost, until I find the right intercooler, then I may turn it up a bit. I'm using this install as a template <A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/dlagrua/turbo.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nbci.com/dlagrua/turbo.htm</A>   with a few changes here and there. I should have it all installed and running in 2-3 weeks.  <P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1711832&a=13494839&p=51748825&Sequence=0"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1711832&a=13494839&p=51748686&Sequence=0"> <P><P>------------------<BR>-Brian, Toolmaker<BR>Lincoln, NE<BR>87' GT-Galaxy silver mettalic, Eibach springs, RSM side scoops, Mr Mikes leather, 70hp NOS, 17" Mille Miglia's, Turbo install in progress.<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1711832&a=12781563&p=48213929&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||The Fieromaster||07-17-2001||06:56 PM||||Nice lookin so far... I am doin similar...<P>Just a word of warning though.. We busted up the vapor canister (the thing you got painted red in the pic) and its full of gass fumes and such!  Since the turbo gets HELLA HOT id relocate that or you might melt it and leak gas everywhere!  that would be bad!<P>------------------<BR>      <FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT><BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">        <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT></B>||||reg||10
Z||000002||sluppy123||07-17-2001||07:23 PM||||Thanks for the heads up on the vapor canister, I already planned on relocating it, just haven't got around to it yet.||||reg||1
